WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.487
Here's how to put Claude on your computer. It takes about five minutes.

00:00:05.387 --> 00:00:09.355
Open your web browser, and go to claude.com/download.

00:00:10.255 --> 00:00:13.510
Pick the download for your computer. Mac, or Windows.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.704
When the download finishes, open the file.

00:00:17.604 --> 00:00:19.749
Follow the steps on the screen to install it.

00:00:20.649 --> 00:00:21.732
Now open Claude.

00:00:22.632 --> 00:00:27.919
Sign in with Google, or with your email. If you use email, Claude sends you a link to tap.

00:00:28.819 --> 00:00:33.200
There's no Claude password. If anyone asks you for one, don't give them anything.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.757
That's it. Claude is on your computer. Tap next step to keep going.

